# Normalize to LF in the repository. Without this, working on Windows commits
# CRLF into files that Prettier and the Cloudflare build both expect to be LF,
# and every checkout on another machine shows the whole tree as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
